# Nissan Sunny B11 four-door saloon, 1982-1986.
#
# The B11 Sunny, the generation launched in Britain in 1982 and the one in
# which the Datsun name gave way to Nissan: the 1982 launch cars were badged
# Datsun, Nissan marks appeared alongside them during 1983, and Datsun UK
# became Nissan UK in February 1984. The four-door saloon is modelled; the
# two-door saloon, the three-door coupe and the estate are not represented.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nissan_Sunny
#
# There was no five-door hatchback B11: that role was filled by the N12
# Cherry, which the pakset already has as nissan-cherry-n12. The N13 of 1986
# replaced both the B11 saloon and the N12 Cherry.
#
# Dimensions 4.050 x 1.620 x 1.360 m, wheelbase 2.400 m (dimension drawings
# on the specification page of the October 1983 UK brochure, which give 755 mm
# front and 895 mm rear overhang for the two- and four-door saloons; the
# height uses the low end of the published range because the brochure figure
# is not legible in the scan).
#
# Shape reference: image 1 is a level side elevation within about 10 degrees
# of perpendicular, on a continental-European car, so the front bumper corner
# and part of the near headlamp face show; the flank is traced from it.
#
# Colours: grade (d); no UK colour page was obtained. White, Red, Blue and
# Silver are plain names. Weights 12, 10, 9, 8, total 39, provisional.
#
# Speed 155 km/h. Comfort 45/248, on the line 180 + 1.5 x 45. Classes 0,1.
# Dates: intro May 1982, European sales beginning that month; retire staggered
# 1995-1999 as a road tail.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/nissan-sunny-b11.blend. Interchange:
# citycars/4.5/nissan-sunny-b11.dae. References:
# citycars/references/nissan-sunny-b11/ (gitignored; Wikimedia Commons).
#
# Accepted deviations: the slightly oblique continental side photograph is
# reconciled to the UK brochure dimensions. Later Nissan, Spirit and Maxima
# badges are deliberately omitted in favour of the Datsun launch badging.
# Window brightwork, hubcaps and lens detail are simplified.


obj=citycar
name=NissanSunnyB11(White)
copyright=JamesPetts

DistributionWeight=12
intro_year=1982
intro_month=5
retire_year=1999
retire_month=6
speed=155
class=0,1
maximum_comfortable_journey_minutes=45
maximum_tolerable_journey_minutes=248

